  "goodToKnow": "Die Psychotherapie is psychotherapy: eine Psychotherapie machen, in Psychotherapie sein. In Germany it's covered by statutory health insurance, but waiting times for a place can be several months. Der Psychotherapeut (die Psychotherapeutin) is the therapist; der Psychiater is a medical doctor who can prescribe medication. German pronounces the p in ps: PSÜ-cho-te-ra-PEE. Sigmund Freud, who wrote in German, founded psychoanalysis."
